842,777-byte carrier binds 55,916 files. It excludes PE/DLL/license/credentials and old full carriers and stays below 95 MiB without artificial splitting. Actual public export and fresh empty-root restoration succeeded. One raw reconstruction from the restored root reproduced all 39 core files byte-for-byte; subsequent comparison passed 619,641 CSV fields and both JSON files. The initial combined comparison hit the standard CSV field-size limit. Only a separate stdlib comparison process's field capacity was increased, with error receipts retained and no reader change, raw rebuild, repack or native rerun. Independent restored-root review passed using public/restored/rebuilt roots only. The historical admission's offline-reader binding is explicitly superseded by the independently reviewed final offline reader; production and performance-helper bindings remain unchanged. Actual recovery receipts are recorded separately after scientific payload commit `a3cac1df0ee1d4eaaeb87343508e0af31cfc3b40`.\n\nR111 stays CONFIRMATION_SUPPORT / R110_MAIN_36_PLUS_R111_SEED_6. R110 stays BLOCKED at old arm 42's whole-cap excess. This finite exposed-role panel is not new independent confirmation, population significance, a paper benchmark or an adoption gate. ENS remains the default; no stopped mechanism is reopened and no winners are spliced across roles. The single next conditional priority is a separately frozen complete attribution experiment, preceded by finite validation of the implicated Windows sharing/atomic-status contract. This round ends with its BLOCKED delivery and does not automatically start that work.\n","created_at":"2026-10-10T19:48:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T19:48:28Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ecb7d3e1b1bd3d3eacf0d6f64eb7c00cf1f3922f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yifanXovo/TailoredExact/pulls/174/commits","review_comme